                "metadata": {
                    "description": "Get ready for a magical journey of mindfulness, where silly meets serene! These delightful, kid-friendly meditations are led by a cast of lovable, quirky characters from the popular podcast What If World. Perfect for ages 4-10, these meditations spark imagination, build emotional resilience, and bring a little calm to your child’s day. This best-of collection is ad-free and edited especially for Yoto.  \n\nIncludes: \nFred’s Sleep Meditation, Cthunkle’s Gratitude Meditation, Zizi’s Courage Meditation, Zach’s Mindfulness Meditation, Randal’s Positivity Meditation, Dracomax’s Bravery Meditation, Petey the Pirate’s Acceptance Meditation... and more!  \n\nWritten & Performed by Eric O’Keeffe Artwork by Ana Stretcu.",
